:: Danny Morning Sendoff
<<npc "Danny">>
Danny is heading out with their bag and camera.
<<if $dannyIntro isnot 1>>
  <<set $dannyIntro to 1>>
  They pause. "Oh. Hi. I'm Danny."
  <<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<<else>>
  <<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 15>>
    They slow for a second. "Morning."
  <<else>>
    They nod and keep moving.
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2000>>
  They look hurried.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Comment on the camera|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Let them go|Orphanage]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Sheets Event
You see Danny bundling wet sheets, moving fast.
<<npc "Danny">> freezes.
<<if C.npc.Danny.love lt 20>>
  "It's nothing." They finish quickly and avoid you.
  <<npcincr Danny love -2>>
<<else>>
  Awkward silence. They mutter an excuse.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Offer to help|Danny Room]]>><<npcincr Danny acceptance 3>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave them|Orphanage]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Hallway Bathroom
<<npc "Danny">> is coming out of the bathroom, bag adjusted.
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2500>>
  They look relieved.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Nod|Hallways]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Ask if they're heading to class|Hallways]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>

:: Danny Library Early
Danny is at a back table, camera out.
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 20>>
  They glance up. "Hey."
<<else>>
  Short nod.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Sit nearby|School Library]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave|Hallways]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Science Seat
You try to sit next to Danny.
<<if random(1, 100) lte 60>>
  The seat is free. You sit. <<npc "Danny">> gives a small nod.
  <<npcincr Danny love 1>>
<<else>>
  The seat is taken.
  <<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 15>>
    Danny mutters, "They were going to sit here."
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Continue|Science Classroom]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Courtyard After
Danny is on the bleachers with their camera.
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 10>>
  They show you a shot.
  <<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<</if>>
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2000>>
  They keep the session short.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|School Rear Courtyard]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Cafeteria Edge
Danny sits at the edge, eating quickly.
<<if C.npc.Danny.continence lte 2500>>
  They finish fast.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Sit nearby|Canteen]]>><<npcincr Danny love 1>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave|Canteen]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Canteen Natural
<<npc "Danny">> is at the edge of the canteen with their camera.
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 25>>
  They look up and shift so there's space.
<<else>>
  They glance over, then back down.
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[Sit with them|Danny Canteen Talk]]>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave them|Canteen]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Canteen Talk
You sit. Danny shows you a photo from earlier.
<<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<br>
<<link [[Continue|Canteen]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Library Natural
<<if getDannyLocation() is "walk" or (Time.hour is 8 and Time.minute lt 45)>>
  <<npc "Danny">> is at a back table reviewing shots.
  <<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 20>>
    "Hey." They move their bag.
  <</if>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Sit nearby|Danny Library Talk]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Danny Library Talk
You sit. Danny quietly shows you a couple of photos.
<<npcincr Danny love 1>>
<br>
<<link [[Continue|School Library]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Courtyard Natural
<<if getDannyLocation() is "courtyard">>
  <<npc "Danny">> is outside with their camera.
  <<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 10>>
    They lower it when they see you.
  <</if>>
  <br>
  <<link [[Approach|Danny Courtyard Talk]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Danny Courtyard Talk
Danny shows you a shot of the field.
<<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<br>
<<link [[Continue|School Rear Courtyard]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Love Photo Walk
<<if C.npc.Danny.love gte 40 and Time.isWeekEnd()>>
  Danny asks if you want to walk and take photos.
  <<link [[Yes|Danny Photo Walk]]>><</link>>
  <<link [[Not now|Danny Room]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Danny Photo Walk
You walk with Danny. They take a few pictures, then one of you.
<<npcincr Danny love 5>>
<br>
<<link [[Back|Danny Room]]>><</link>>

:: Danny Stay Over
It's late. Danny pulls a spare blanket from the cupboard and points you at the floor by the desk.
"It's not much, but you can stay. I'll be in the bed."
<br><br>
You settle on the floor. Danny turns the light off and stays on their side of the room. You both sleep until morning.
<<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<br>
<<link [[Wake up|Danny Room]]>><</link>>

:: Canteen Lunch Danny
You sit with Danny. They eat quietly and show you a photo from earlier.
<<npcincr Danny love 2>>
<<set $plusHunger to Math.min(($plusHunger || 0) + 40, $plusHungerMax || 100)>>
<<set $plusThirst to Math.min(($plusThirst || 0) + 30, $plusThirstMax || 100)>>
<br>
<<link [[Continue|Canteen]]>><</link>>
